{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Fluid Resources API",
    "description": "Public contract for token issuance and token-related public endpoints.\n\n## Authentication\n\n- **`/oauth2/token`** — public endpoint; supports `client_credentials` (M2M only).\n- **`/oauth2/token-fluid-legacy`** — legacy Fluid-signed M2M JWT endpoint (deprecated, prefer `/oauth2/token`).\n- **`/users/token`** — public endpoint for end-user bootstrap token issuance. Supports Bearer M2M or HTTP Basic Auth.\n- **`/users/token/exchange`** — exchanges a short-lived bootstrap token for a Hydra-managed session (access_token + refresh_token).\n- **`/users/token/refresh`** — renews a user session using a Hydra refresh token. The client secret is handled server-side and must not be exposed to browsers.\n- **`/.well-known/jwks.json`** — public key discovery for Fluid-signed JWT validation.\n\n## Scopes\n\n| Scope | Description |\n|---|---|\n| `fluid:api` | Full access to the Fluid API |\nOpenAPI contract for integration resource operations (flowkits, connectors, etc.).\n\n## Authentication\n\nAll endpoints require a **Bearer** token obtained via the token issuance flow.\nSee `docs/openapi/token/public.yaml` for token acquisition.\n\n## Endpoints\n\n| Tag | Description |\n|---|---|\n| `flowkits` | Available flowkit definitions |\n| `activations` | Activated flowkit instances per tenant |",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "contact": {
      "name": "Fluid API Team",
      "email": "api@fluidapi.com"
    },
    "license": {
      "name": "Proprietary",
      "identifier": "LicenseRef-Proprietary"
    }
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "{scheme}://{host}",
      "description": "Configurable environment",
      "variables": {
        "scheme": {
          "default": "https",
          "enum": [
            "http",
            "https"
          ]
        },
        "host": {
          "default": "id.dev.api.fluidapi.io",
          "enum": [
            "id.dev.api.fluidapi.io",
            "id.api.fluidapi.io",
            "localhost:9999"
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "tokens",
      "description": "Public — Token issuance for tenants"
    },
    {
      "name": "session",
      "description": "Public — User session lifecycle (exchange + refresh)"
    },
    {
      "name": "metadata",
      "description": "Public — Metadata and health endpoints"
    },
    {
      "name": "flowkits",
      "description": "Available flowkit definitions (catalog)"
    },
    {
      "name": "activations",
      "description": "Activated flowkit instances — list, activate and delete"
    }
  ],
